OL,3,AIsrael warns it will retaliate if UK
OL,4,Aimposes sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's Foreign Minister Gideon Saar
OL,7,Fhas warned his country will retaliate
OL,8,Fif the UK imposes sanctions against it
OL,9,Fover the potential expansion of
OL,10,Fsettlements in the West Bank.
OL,12,FAddressing Parliament for the first
OL,13,Ftime as foreign secretary, Ed Miliband
OL,14,Fsaid he would introduce a
OL,15,F"comprehensive reset" of policy on
OL,16,FIsrael "in the coming weeks".
OL,18,FHe said the government would examine
OL,19,Fhow to stop UK companies "financing,
OL,20,Fconstructing or advertising new
OL,21,Fsettlements" in the occupied West Bank.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
