OL,3,AIsrael warns it will retaliate if UK
OL,4,Aimposes sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FResponding, Gideon Saar told
OL,7,FHebrew-language news website Ynet: "If
OL,8,FBritain acts against Israel, Israel
OL,9,Fwill act against Britain."
